==English==

===Etymology===

From {{confix|tele|genic}}, by analogy with [[photogenic]].

===Pronunciation===
*: {{rhymes|ɛnɪk}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# having an [[appearance]] and exhibiting [[qualities]] thought to be [[attractive]] to [[television]] [[viewer]]s
#: ''The young politician was very '''telegenic'''.''
